WEBVTT

00:19:59.373 --> 00:20:01.472
By working with Victoria
to shift her mindset

00:20:01.496 --> 00:20:03.130
and build proactive habits,

00:20:03.154 --> 00:20:05.611
Rachel has overcome impostor syndrome.

00:20:05.635 --> 00:20:07.821
RB: Coaching gave me
the confidence to know

00:20:07.845 --> 00:20:09.667
that it's fine to not know stuff.

00:20:09.972 --> 00:20:11.996
I have to accept that some of these people

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:14.489
have 20 years experience in doing this.

00:20:14.513 --> 00:20:17.127
I have absolutely
no bother now saying to them,

00:20:17.151 --> 00:20:19.105
"Guys, can you just summarize that for me

00:20:19.129 --> 00:20:21.304
and tell me what I need to know?"

00:20:21.328 --> 00:20:23.608
AG: Now, Rachel is successfully
leading her team

00:20:23.632 --> 00:20:25.505
with a clear and compelling vision.

00:20:25.529 --> 00:20:26.900
And when it comes to tech,

00:20:26.924 --> 00:20:28.634
she's starting to sound like a pro.

00:20:28.658 --> 00:20:31.834
RB: In the context
of how we deliver work in our AVS,